WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.340
OPENING

00:05.270 --> 00:10.170
I will ask our newly appointed
Vice Commander to explain.

00:10.470 --> 00:11.600
Enter.

00:22.120 --> 00:27.320
I'm Jin Tsurusawa. As of today, I have been
appointed Vice Commander of Phantom.

00:27.660 --> 00:29.620
You serious?

00:29.620 --> 00:32.160
So what? You wanna be friends again?

00:32.160 --> 00:34.690
Watch your mouth.

00:36.030 --> 00:38.730
I am your superior officer.

00:41.500 --> 00:43.240
So that's the way it'll be.

00:43.240 --> 00:46.240
I'll leave the rest to you,
Vice Commander Tsurusawa.

00:46.240 --> 00:47.170
Yes, sir.

00:50.450 --> 00:54.050
I await your orders, Vice Commander.

00:54.050 --> 00:56.480
Confirm the location of the target,
which disappeared off Tosa,

00:56.480 --> 01:00.050
and check for any survivors from the Ishin crew.

01:00.260 --> 01:04.060
The Gladiators have already
been equipped with regulators.

01:04.060 --> 01:05.930
Get on it at once.

01:05.930 --> 01:07.030
Yes, sir.

01:07.030 --> 01:09.550
Damn it, so he wants us to do the dirty work...

01:11.900 --> 01:25.270
Sora ni toketa hane o matoi tobitate tsubasa de

01:11.900 --> 01:18.510
Cloaked in feathers melted into the sky

01:18.510 --> 01:25.280
Take flight on wings

01:39.620 --> 01:42.790
Morokute nigai kajitsu no you ni

01:39.630 --> 01:42.800
Like fragile but bitter fruit

01:42.790 --> 01:46.000
Hito no kokoro o miryou suru no

01:42.800 --> 01:46.010
It fascinates people's hearts

01:46.000 --> 01:49.100
Togi sumasareta shiroi yubi de

01:46.010 --> 01:47.510
The shadow that manipulates

01:47.510 --> 01:49.110
With sharpened fingers gleaming white

01:49.100 --> 01:52.270
Ayatsuru kage wa chi no kaori

01:49.110 --> 01:52.280
Smells of blood

01:52.270 --> 02:05.270
Shizumi aseta kodou o yobi samasu shi no sasayaki

01:52.280 --> 01:58.720
The whisper of Death

01:58.720 --> 02:05.280
That awakens fading heartbeats

02:06.250 --> 02:12.620
Sora ni toketa hane o matoi

02:06.260 --> 02:12.630
Cloaked in feathers melted into the sky

02:12.620 --> 02:18.860
Tobitatsu no wa gin no tsubasa

02:12.630 --> 02:18.870
Silver wings take flight

02:18.860 --> 02:25.340
Fukai kaze ni tsume o tatete

02:18.870 --> 02:25.340
Become the power that tears at deep winds

02:25.340 --> 02:35.070
Kirisaku chikara to nare

02:25.340 --> 02:35.080
With poised claws

02:36.060 --> 02:39.250
Brought to you by
BiG-GuY Fansubbing

02:39.840 --> 02:44.350
Episode 10
Determination

02:40.260 --> 02:41.820
Escape boat, secured.

02:41.820 --> 02:44.030
Priority should be given to transporting
those in need of medical assistance.

02:44.030 --> 02:45.030
Get a stretcher ready.

02:45.030 --> 02:46.490
We've sent over a stretcher!

02:46.490 --> 02:48.900
The first-aid station is ready to receive patients.

02:47.530 --> 02:49.830
Give me the rope.

02:49.830 --> 02:50.870
Where's the oxygen?

02:50.870 --> 02:52.700
Okay, you'll be all right.

02:52.700 --> 02:54.630
Come on, stay with me now.

02:54.740 --> 02:57.470
Calm down! Come up slowly!

02:58.210 --> 03:00.140
Okay! Next!

03:00.410 --> 03:01.810
There you go.

03:03.240 --> 03:05.010
I made it!

03:05.010 --> 03:07.450
Boss, that's everyone!

03:07.450 --> 03:08.280
All right.

03:10.120 --> 03:13.550
We have been waiting for you. This way, please.

03:34.910 --> 03:36.770
I've brought them here.

03:38.480 --> 03:42.970
Boy, we sure both got our butts kicked, didn't we?

03:43.180 --> 03:45.520
Yeah, pretty pathetic.

03:45.520 --> 03:50.220
I was worried when I heard the
National Defense Force had sunk you...

03:50.630 --> 03:53.030
Well, I'm glad you're safe.

03:53.030 --> 03:55.430
Well, not really.

03:55.430 --> 03:57.370
Enough about me, how are you doing?

03:57.370 --> 03:59.670
I won't be able to move for a while.

03:59.670 --> 04:02.840
There are still fragments left in my body.

04:02.840 --> 04:04.630
I see...

04:05.470 --> 04:07.140
Hey, Toraji...

04:07.140 --> 04:08.370
Yeah?

04:09.140 --> 04:11.700
Have you made up your mind?

04:15.380 --> 04:17.040
You still haven't?!

04:17.190 --> 04:19.650
You're injured, you need to just shut up and rest!

04:23.890 --> 04:26.490
I'll take care of the rest somehow.

04:26.590 --> 04:28.120
Th-Then...

04:31.230 --> 04:34.830
We'll gather our comrades here
and give them the command.

04:37.510 --> 04:41.410
You... finally...

04:46.150 --> 04:48.880
Losing just isn't my style.

04:58.330 --> 05:01.920
This is Steve. I don't see any wreckage
of the escape boat.

05:02.660 --> 05:06.270
Any signs of our target, or
Shiba and Katsuragi's remains?

05:06.270 --> 05:08.760
No, can't find 'em.

05:09.070 --> 05:11.830
Same here. I cannot find anything.

05:12.310 --> 05:14.330
Just as I thought.

05:15.040 --> 05:17.550
Mission complete. Everyone, withdraw.

05:17.550 --> 05:18.710
Roger.

05:19.680 --> 05:23.280
So now, what's their move?

05:46.070 --> 05:47.040
Joe.

05:48.810 --> 05:51.050
Shouldn't you be resting?

05:51.050 --> 05:52.540
Yeah.

05:57.450 --> 06:00.620
I've been thinking about a lot of stuff.

06:08.700 --> 06:12.900
I want... to see Jin again...

06:12.900 --> 06:14.460
Sana...

06:15.040 --> 06:19.530
No, it's not what you think.

06:21.480 --> 06:28.680
I just want to know. What I am, what I have...

06:28.680 --> 06:33.120
I want to see Jin one more time and find out!

06:33.890 --> 06:35.550
So are you saying you want to go back?

06:46.330 --> 06:48.890
All right, then I'll go too.

06:49.140 --> 06:50.630
Joe!

06:57.680 --> 06:59.580
Thank you.

07:07.980 --> 07:10.490
Office of the Chief of
National Defense

07:09.520 --> 07:10.730
Come in.

07:16.760 --> 07:21.400
Drake has been leaking classified
information to the Freedom States.

07:21.400 --> 07:24.500
He was a spy for the States!

07:25.010 --> 07:28.410
Oh? Drake was...

07:28.410 --> 07:32.150
As you can see, we decoded the
encoded telegram he transmitted

07:32.150 --> 07:36.210
and discovered that he had leaked the information
to mass produce Gladiators to them.

07:36.950 --> 07:38.790
I see...

07:38.790 --> 07:40.150
And so?

07:40.860 --> 07:43.120
What do you mean, "and so"?

07:43.120 --> 07:45.820
What are you going to do with me?

07:47.460 --> 07:48.990
Drake!

07:49.130 --> 07:52.000
Wh-What's going on here?

07:52.870 --> 07:55.730
I see you're still pretty slow to catch on.

07:56.240 --> 07:58.170
Th-This can't be...

07:58.170 --> 08:01.070
Well, that's exactly how it is, Mr. Katsura.

08:03.310 --> 08:08.010
The National Defense Force is already
under the jurisdiction of the Freedom States.

08:16.420 --> 08:21.360
Jeez, I can't believe you're asking me this.

08:21.360 --> 08:22.760
Please let us go.

08:22.760 --> 08:25.300
I promise not to cause
trouble for you. So please.

08:25.300 --> 08:28.670
It's not about causing trouble or anything like that!

08:32.170 --> 08:36.280
Besides, you think you can really
protect Sana in that condition?

08:36.280 --> 08:39.740
Don't worry. I'm fine now.

08:40.950 --> 08:43.580
Sana! And what about you?

08:43.580 --> 08:46.920
You really wanna go that far
to find out about yourself?

08:49.360 --> 08:53.060
I want to know. I want to see him and find out.

08:53.060 --> 08:57.090
By hearing it from Jin... In his own words!

09:02.340 --> 09:04.610
You guys are hopeless.

09:04.610 --> 09:06.070
So you'll let us go?

09:06.070 --> 09:09.840
"Don't go!" Even if I said that,
you'd go anyway, right?

09:11.650 --> 09:13.950
I'll lend you a gunship.

09:13.950 --> 09:16.080
Hijin, take care of these guys.

09:16.080 --> 09:18.750
Sure thing. I knew you'd say that.

09:18.750 --> 09:19.950
Sorry.

09:19.950 --> 09:21.680
I'm going too.

09:22.020 --> 09:27.120
It's too dangerous with just you two.
I'd better go with you.

09:27.460 --> 09:29.430
Right. Do whatever you want.

09:29.630 --> 09:30.570
Gonza!

09:30.570 --> 09:34.430
Here we go. The satellite photos
of the lab are up now.

09:37.670 --> 09:40.270
Looks like we can enter from here.

09:41.280 --> 09:42.640
Let me do it.

09:43.040 --> 09:44.510
Boss?

09:44.510 --> 09:46.170
Let her do it.

09:46.680 --> 09:47.770
Okay.

09:50.520 --> 09:53.150
This is the Gladiator hangar.

09:53.220 --> 09:57.730
There are two routes to get there, but one is fake.

09:57.730 --> 10:00.920
So if we use this route then...

10:01.200 --> 10:03.600
Boss, Boss...

10:03.600 --> 10:05.730
You sure we can trust her?

10:05.730 --> 10:09.500
Don't worry. She's back.

10:10.400 --> 10:13.270
Back to the Renée I used to know before.

10:15.580 --> 10:16.810
Hmph!

10:16.810 --> 10:19.150
What the hell was that for?

10:19.150 --> 10:21.140
You asked for it.

10:32.130 --> 10:33.750
Can I ask you something?

10:35.260 --> 10:38.270
You said you wanted to see him
and find out for yourself...

10:38.270 --> 10:41.700
But you don't know if he'll tell you the truth.

10:41.700 --> 10:44.110
That's right. You're a smart one, Aunty!

10:45.170 --> 10:47.660
If he doesn't tell me the truth,
I'll just have to make him.

10:48.880 --> 10:52.610
So you still trust him? A guy like that?

10:52.980 --> 10:55.550
Yeah, right!

10:55.550 --> 10:58.120
They were badly beaten by him.

10:58.120 --> 11:00.150
When you get beaten,
you return the favor twofold.

11:00.150 --> 11:03.490
You're really going back to get revenge. Am I right?

11:05.960 --> 11:09.060
Well, I don't really care.

11:09.060 --> 11:12.460
But just keep this in mind.

11:13.370 --> 11:18.430
Make sure you finish off anyone
who pleads for his life. Got that?

11:21.910 --> 11:23.470
I know.

11:41.230 --> 11:44.530
Why don't you just let a
mechanic take care of that?

11:45.170 --> 11:49.970
Are you taking precautions?
So you won't end up like Riki?

11:50.640 --> 11:53.370
Well, who cares about that.

11:53.570 --> 11:57.770
More importantly, do you think they're still alive?

11:58.750 --> 12:00.410
That's a stupid question.

12:00.410 --> 12:05.220
We're standing by because there's a chance
that they're alive and will attack us.

12:05.790 --> 12:08.480
Don't get any funny ideas now.

12:12.760 --> 12:16.460
You're in the grip of Death.

12:22.540 --> 12:23.970
That's...

12:34.920 --> 12:36.250
Be careful.

12:36.480 --> 12:38.020
Take care of Sana.

12:38.020 --> 12:39.610
Sure, leave it to me.

12:41.820 --> 12:43.080
Joe...

13:37.810 --> 13:40.110
Well, it's about time you got here.

13:40.950 --> 13:42.110
Jin!

13:42.180 --> 13:45.580
Everyone was getting tired of waiting
for you to come back.

13:53.090 --> 13:55.860
Okay, start talking.

13:56.160 --> 13:58.530
Where is Sana Nobuto right now?

13:58.530 --> 14:01.140
Jin! Come with me!

14:01.140 --> 14:02.260
What?

14:02.470 --> 14:05.300
Sana wants to see you!

14:13.080 --> 14:15.450
She wants to see me?

14:15.450 --> 14:19.720
I didn't know you were the kind of guy
who told such funny jokes!

14:19.890 --> 14:24.230
I'm not lying. Sana wants to hear
the truth from your mouth.

14:24.230 --> 14:26.690
The truth?

14:30.230 --> 14:33.970
What people desire is not the truth.

14:33.970 --> 14:37.430
They want gentle lies, Joe.

14:38.510 --> 14:43.910
Sweet ideals and illusions that will help them
look away from harsh reality.

14:43.910 --> 14:46.110
That's what people want.

14:47.820 --> 14:51.650
I'll ask you one more time.
Where is Sana Nobuto?

14:51.720 --> 14:56.090
I promised her. That I would take you to Sana.

14:57.160 --> 15:01.820
You don't seem to understand the situation.
That's a shame, Joe.

15:25.190 --> 15:26.240
Take this!

15:27.820 --> 15:29.550
Damn you!

15:29.990 --> 15:32.660
Kyoushiro! Don't get in our line of fire!

15:32.660 --> 15:33.960
You'll get in the way of our attack!

15:38.000 --> 15:38.930
Bastard!

15:39.570 --> 15:40.430
Don't shoot!

15:40.430 --> 15:41.420
Dammit.

15:43.070 --> 15:43.740
Do it.

15:43.740 --> 15:44.370
Yes, sir!
Do it.

15:58.950 --> 16:01.320
Did they install that device?

16:01.320 --> 16:03.590
And not only that, they purposely
removed the limiter?

16:06.960 --> 16:10.860
Inverted nerve pulse. Before long,
he'll break through his threshold.

16:10.860 --> 16:13.100
Come on, say it, Joe.

16:13.100 --> 16:15.730
Or else you'll die in a rampage.

16:25.650 --> 16:27.340
Wait for me, Sana...

16:27.980 --> 16:33.390
I will... I will bring Jin to you without fail...

16:33.650 --> 16:35.260
Threshold broken through!

16:35.260 --> 16:36.920
Oh wait, what's this?

16:36.920 --> 16:38.360
What it is?

16:38.360 --> 16:43.300
The feedback signal from the black box is
aligning with the cognitive noise of the pilot

16:43.300 --> 16:45.330
and is creating a waveform of its own.

16:45.330 --> 16:46.590
What?!

17:05.820 --> 17:07.220
Move, Steve! Kyoushiro!

17:19.270 --> 17:21.030
You kids are...

17:21.340 --> 17:22.770
Move!

17:23.000 --> 17:24.170
This is...

17:24.170 --> 17:25.760
You're supposed to be dead!

17:26.810 --> 17:27.770
He disappeared?

17:31.110 --> 17:32.410
Bastard!

17:36.080 --> 17:36.880
What the...

17:37.790 --> 17:39.340
Damn you!

17:48.300 --> 17:53.000
Awesome! That's awesome!
What an incredible reaction rate.

17:53.000 --> 17:54.900
They're completely in synch.

18:01.940 --> 18:05.610
Wonderful! You're wonderful, Joe!

18:18.690 --> 18:20.890
Die!

18:32.670 --> 18:33.510
Go!

18:33.510 --> 18:34.700
Steve!

18:35.080 --> 18:37.980
Get the truth out of that man!

18:38.380 --> 18:42.820
If what he says is true and reality
is indeed cruel and harsh,

18:42.820 --> 18:44.720
then you just have to change it.

18:59.630 --> 19:02.330
Done in by a mere Light Warrior...

19:07.440 --> 19:08.600
Steve!

19:36.400 --> 19:38.000
Over here! Secure the exit!

19:55.520 --> 19:56.580
Jin!

20:07.570 --> 20:09.600
Joe...

20:09.600 --> 20:11.370
Your tears...

20:15.380 --> 20:17.040
They're not coming out.

20:24.850 --> 20:25.980
Joe!

20:28.090 --> 20:29.820
Hurry! Get me a tourniquet.

20:29.820 --> 20:31.050
Okay!

20:49.380 --> 20:52.610
Commander! Vice-Commander Tsurusawa
was taken away.

21:01.260 --> 21:03.990
Where is Tsurusawa right now?

21:05.960 --> 21:08.390
He's probably with Venus.

21:14.670 --> 21:15.800
Where am I?

21:15.800 --> 21:17.670
So you've come to.

21:19.370 --> 21:24.170
Jin. Tell Sana everything.

21:26.350 --> 21:29.710
You sure I should do that?

21:30.920 --> 21:37.820
I told you before. You'll be struck down by
harsh reality and will begin to detest yourself.

21:41.330 --> 21:43.690
That's fine with me.

21:44.000 --> 21:45.060
Sana.

21:47.800 --> 21:50.070
I'm not going to run away anymore.

22:00.350 --> 22:04.340
Fine. I'll tell you everything.

22:25.170 --> 22:29.680
Nagai kioku no hate ni

22:25.170 --> 22:29.640
If at the end of our long memory

22:29.640 --> 22:35.480
Time will tear us apart

22:29.680 --> 22:35.510
Toki ga bokura o wakatsu nara

22:37.520 --> 22:44.160
If at the end of my sweet memory with you

22:37.550 --> 22:44.190
Kimi to amai kioku no hate ni

22:44.160 --> 22:50.460
You and I become one again

22:44.190 --> 22:50.500
Mata bokura hitotsu nara

22:50.460 --> 22:57.640
From a quietly stretched arm's length away

22:50.500 --> 22:57.670
Sotto te nobashita kyori kara

22:57.640 --> 23:02.340
I will search for the meaning

22:57.670 --> 23:02.380
lmi o sagasu kara

23:02.340 --> 23:08.180
Can you hear it? The words dance in midair

23:02.380 --> 23:08.220
Kikoeru? Kotoba ga chuu ni mau

23:08.180 --> 23:13.990
We shall meet when our wish is granted

23:08.220 --> 23:14.020
Kanaeta toki ni deau

23:13.990 --> 23:17.660
Leaving only their reverse behind

23:14.020 --> 23:17.690
Reverse dake nokoshite

23:17.660 --> 23:21.060
The torn words

23:17.690 --> 23:21.090
Chigireta kotoba

23:21.060 --> 23:27.190
Blurred time and light

23:21.090 --> 23:27.230
Kasureta jikan to hikari

23:29.370 --> 23:33.700
I have found them now

23:29.400 --> 23:33.740
lma, mitsuketa kara

23:35.300 --> 23:44.520
Next Episode

23:44.680 --> 23:47.320
Next time on Innocent Venus:

23:47.480 --> 23:50.740
Episode 11
Venus

23:47.820 --> 23:49.520
"Venus"
